 <div class="box">
  <div class="logo"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19c0-8 5-14 14-14 0 9-6 14-14 14zM5 19c3-4 6-7 9-9"/></svg></i><b>fabcycle</b></div>
